## Endpoints

Paths are relative to the hub's address (the one a person signs in at); on Parachute Cloud it is `https://my.parachute.computer`.

- MCP: `<hub>/vault/<vault>/mcp`. OAuth on the first connection; the `/mcp` suffix is required.
- REST: `<hub>/vault/<vault>/api/records` (0.9; `/api/notes` on 0.8), `Authorization: Bearer <key>`.
- Hub health: `<hub>/health`. Vault health: `<hub>/vault/<vault>/health` (401 means it is up and refusing strangers).

